      * PAYCALC - PURE PREMIUM CALCULATION, CALLED BY BILLGEN.
      * NO FILE OR DATABASE ACCESS: NUMBERS IN, AMOUNT OUT.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PAYCALC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-BASE-RATE         PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE 120.50.
       01  WS-RISK-FACTOR       PIC S9(3)V99 VALUE 1.25.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LS-BILL-RECORD.
           05  LS-BILL-AMOUNT   PIC S9(7)V99.
       01  LS-PAY-AMOUNT        PIC S9(7)V99.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-BILL-RECORD LS-PAY-AMOUNT.
       MAIN-PARA.
           PERFORM APPLY-RATE
           PERFORM ROUND-AMOUNT
           GOBACK.
       APPLY-RATE.
           COMPUTE LS-PAY-AMOUNT = WS-BASE-RATE * WS-RISK-FACTOR.
       ROUND-AMOUNT.
           COMPUTE LS-BILL-AMOUNT ROUNDED = LS-PAY-AMOUNT.
